        },
        {
          "name": "Death Knell",
          "type": "spell",
          "level": 2,
          "heightenedLevel": 2,
          "timesPrepared": 1,
          "traits": [
            "concentrate",
            "death",
            "manipulate"
          ],
          "castingTime": "2",
          "duration": "",
          "range": "touch",
          "area": "",
          "targets": "1 living creature that has 0 HP",
          "save": "will",
          "description": "<p>You snuff the life out of a creature on the brink of death. The target must attempt a Will save. If this kills it, you gain 10 temporary HP and a +1 status bonus to attack and damage rolls for 10 minutes.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target's Dying value increases by 1.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target dies.</p>\n<p></p>",
          "cast": false,
          "cost": "",
          "primaryCheck": "",
          "secondaryCasters": "",
          "secondaryChecks": "",
          "id": "jUAm540uEAU6hGmp"
        },
        {
          "name": "Invisibility (At Will) (self only)",
          "type": "spell",
          "level": 2,
          "heightenedLevel": 2,
          "timesPrepared": 1,
          "traits": [
            "illusion",
            "manipulate"
          ],
          "castingTime": "2",
          "duration": "10 minutes",
          "range": "touch",
          "area": "",
          "targets": "self",
          "save": "",
          "description": "<p>Cloaked in illusion, the target becomes Invisible. This makes it Undetected to all creatures, though the creatures can attempt to find the target, making it Hidden to them instead. If the target uses a hostile action, the spell ends after that hostile action is completed.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> The spell lasts 1 minute, but it doesn't end if the target uses a hostile action.</p>",
          "cast": false,
          "cost": "",
          "primaryCheck": "",
          "secondaryCasters": "",
          "secondaryChecks": "",
          "id": "ah5UAOtBrrFFz246"
        },
        {
          "name": "Vomit Swarm",
          "type": "spell",
          "level": 2,
          "heightenedLevel": 2,
          "timesPrepared": 1,
          "traits": [
            "concentrate",
            "manipulate"
          ],
          "castingTime": "2",
          "duration": "",
          "range": "",
          "area": "30ft cone",
          "targets": "",
          "save": "Basic reflex",
          "description": "<p>You belch forth a swarm of magical vermin. You evoke and shape the creatures from your own imagination, allowing you to change the appearance of the creatures (typically a mix of centipedes, roaches, wasps, and worms), but this doesn't change the effect of the spell. The vermin swarm over anyone in the area, their bites and stings dealing 2d8 Piercing Damage damage (basic Reflex save). A creature that fails its saving throw also becomes Sickened 1. Once the spell ends, the swarm disappears.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> Increase the damage by 1d8 Piercing Damage.</p>",
